<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xmlns:cbml="http://www.cbml.org/ns/1.0">
   <teiHeader>
      <fileDesc>
         <titleStmt>
            <title xml:id="i2" n="3">It's a Granny vs. Granny Clash!</title>
         </titleStmt>
         <publicationStmt>
            <p>Publication Information</p>
         </publicationStmt>
         <sourceDesc>
            <p>Information about the source</p>
         </sourceDesc>
      </fileDesc>
   </teiHeader>
   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="event" xml:id="i3-event1">
            <stage type="location" where="tvStudio"/>
            <pb n="1"/>


            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Sekio">
               <p>YOUR AGE...</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Sekio">
               <p>...IS 27</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Shoma">
               <p>I'M 20</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <pb n="2"/>
            <cbml:caption> PSYCHIC POWERS EXPOSED </cbml:caption>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Sekio">
               <p>YOUR FAVORITE FOOD IS CURRY!</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Shoma">
               <p>IT'S RAMEN ACTUALLY.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>YOU HAVE A WIFE AND A CHILD.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Shoma">
               <p>I LIVE ALONE.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>
         </div>
         <div type="event" xml:id="i3-event2">
            <stage type="location" where="backstage"/>
            <pb n="3"/>
            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>THANK YPU FOR YOUR APPEARANCE TODAY!</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>BOY,THAT SANTA DODORIA IS SOMETHING ELSE, HUH?</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>THEY WERE SO WRONG IT WAS ACTUALLY KINDA SATISFYING.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>AS IF AN IDOL THAT YOUNG WOULD HAVE A WIFE AND KIDS!</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>EVEN I COULDVE GUESSED THAT!</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>ARE WE JUST GONNA RUN THE EPISODE AS IS?</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>IT'LL BE FINE. NOBODY'S GONNA BE UP IN ARMS ABOUT A LOCAL SHOW LIKE THIS
                  ANYWAY.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>
         </div>

         <div type="event" xml:id="i3-event3">
            <stage type="location" where="car"/>
            <pb n="4"/>
            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>YOU'RE SANTA DODORIA, AREN'T YOU?</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>I'VE SEEN YOU ON TV. DO YOU ACTUALLY HAVE PSYCHIC ABILITIES?</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>YOU CAN LET ME OUT HERE.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Extra">
               <p>HUH? BUT... I WASN'T TRYING TO BE INSULTING OR ANYTHING. I WAS JUST HOPING YOU
                  COULD SHOW ME SOMETHING...</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>IF YOU DON'T WANT AN EARLY DEATH, THEN GET OUT OF HERE NOW.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech">
               <p>...</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <pb n="7"/>
            <cbml:balloon type="speech">
               <p>?!</p>
            </cbml:balloon>

            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>MY, MY, MY, AND HERE I THOUGHT YOU'D BROUGHT ANOTHER TRASH BOY HOME.</p>
            </cbml:balloon>
            
            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>TURNS OUT HE'S NOT EVEN HUMAN, IS HE?</p>
            </cbml:balloon>
            
            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>TRULY, MY GRAND-DAUGHTER BRINGS ME NOTHING BUT TROUBLE </p>
            </cbml:balloon>
            
            <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Seiko">
               <p>MY SKIN'S DRIED FROM THE STRESS OF IT ALL!</p>
            </cbml:balloon>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>
